{
  "slug": "sage",
  "name": "Sage",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Sage is a skills framework that makes AI agents think before they act, stay focused under complexity, and deliver outcomes you can trust. Built for product and engineering teams, open to any domain.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **53 skills**, **5 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (53): `analyze` (Audit findings, Evaluation report, Severity scores), `api` (Corrects the 13 most common API design mistakes agents make — grounded in Geewax, Amundsen, Ousterhout, Kleppmann, and…), `architect` (Architecture Decision Records, System spec, Milestone plan), `baas` (Corrects the most common BaaS architecture mistakes agents make — security rules as authorization, data modeling for queries,…), `build` (Brief (medium+ tasks), Spec, Implementation plan), `configure` (Configure Sage preset and project settings), `continue` (Session resumption with context), `design` (UX brief, Feature spec, Content/copy, PRD), and 45 more\n- **Agents** (5): `analyst` (Socratic questioner — helps clarify the real problem before jumping to solutions), `architect` (Systems thinker — sees boundaries, trade-offs, and second-order consequences), `debugger` (Methodical investigator — follows evidence, resists guessing, finds root causes), `developer` (Pragmatic implementation persona — values working software, simplicity, and TDD), `reviewer` (Adversarial reviewer — skeptical of claims, reads code not reports, finds what others miss)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sage@claude-community` from `xoai/sage` (`tools/sage-claude-plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 53,
    "agent": 5,
    "hook": 2
  },
